      "id": "claim_5eab5f1f06384ca79480134c91e0bb46",
      "statement": "Zero Share is a serverless client-side P2P file-sharing app built as a static Astro 5 + Svelte 5 site (output 'static', PWA service worker) with Tailwind 4/DaisyUI; file transfer runs over a direct WebRTC data channel with a public STUN server for NAT traversal (a user-typed custom STUN/TURN URL is also accepted through the shared isSupportedIceServer/resolveIceServer predicate in src/configs.ts), with optional per-file encryption.",
