      "id": "claim_723892aec58942a299d2fc732ea50d7a",
      "statement": "The npm scripts are dev/start (astro dev), build (astro build to ./build), test (node --no-warnings --test \\\"tests/*.test.mjs\\\" — the Node built-in runner over ALL thirty-seven tests/*.test.mjs regression-guard files in one invocation; the test-case count inside them is 41), lint (prettier --check . && eslint .), format (prettier --write .), and protogen (protoc + ts-proto regenerating src/proto/message.ts). The Zero Factory precommit hook's default/all path runs format (npx prettier --write . + npx eslint . --fix), then build (npx tsc --noEmit + npm run build), then test (npm test — all 37 regression-guard files).",
